                "message": "🐛 Never delete meta lines, values or tags in sp-litnotes-meta-fill\n\n- Empty or nil values never replace a value (--set and --put do nothing)\n- A person line with more names than BibTeX is not \"updated\"\n- New lines go after the continuation lines of the last item\n- Every fill is checked against the text from before and refused, with the note restored, if a line, value or tag is lost\n- Tests for the single and batch fill, doc bullets\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAMJzQKB6duQ22aU2d",
